Z||000000||Steve Normington||08-21-2001||01:01 PM||||Scott (FieroKid) had a cool idea to make a set of Fiero icons and cursors for Windows (busy, My Computer, etc). If you want your Fiero too be in the list, post an image here. To make it easier for me, try to post images without reflections from the paint. For example, SmoooooothGT's image would be great because he has that matte paint.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> The kind of images that I am looking for are side, rear, and front views of fastbacks and notchbacks, engine compartments (w/ and w/o engine), dashboards, etc. Remember that icons and cursors are only 32 pixels x 32 pixels so details will be lost. Also I can use suggestions, for example, what will be the full and empty images for the trashcan.||||reg||1
